<title>JAPAN: Honda - 9mth group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Honda - 9mth group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.81 trln	 vs	    2.97 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  261.20		vs	   86.78</p>
<p> Pretax	     259.22		vs	   66.68</p>
<p> Net		  156.82		vs	   42.56</p>
<p> EPS		  160.94 yen	  vs	   43.68 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Honda Motor Co Ltd is a leading car and motorcycle manufacturer. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
